{"id":"caae2f23e6ca3d53","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations.md","title":"遗传有效运算的外延 PER","display":"df-hereditarily-effective-operations — 遗传有效运算的外延 PER","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations","aliases":["72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations"],"display":"df-hereditarily-effective-operations — 遗传有效运算的外延 PER","depends_on":["[[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]","[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]"],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §3.3(iii), print431/PDF443; equivalent cross-application PER presentation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source clause correspondence checked; PER proof in downstream lemma","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hereditarily-effective-operations — 遗传有效运算的外延 PER"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"161f0473a5123eab\" href=\"?note=161f0473a5123eab\" title=\"72-df-realizer-finite-types\">72-df-realizer-finite-types</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §3.3(iii), print431/PDF443; equivalent cross-application PER presentation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source clause correspondence checked; PER proof in downstream lemma"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>类型与编号、配对取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"161f0473a5123eab\" href=\"?note=161f0473a5123eab\" title=\"72-df-realizer-finite-types\">72-df-realizer-finite-types</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,d,a,b,u,v\\in\\omega\">\\(e,d,a,b,u,v\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_\\sigma\">\\(\\sim_\\sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HEO}_\\sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{HEO}_\\sigma\\)</span> 按严格子类型递归定义；函数条款中的两个输出都必须存在。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\ne\\sim_{\\mathbf n}d&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow e=d,\\\\\ne\\sim_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}d&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow p_0(e)\\sim_\\sigma p_0(d)\\land p_1(e)\\sim_\\tau p_1(d),\\\\\ne\\sim_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}d&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl[a\\sim_\\sigma b\\Rightarrow\n\\exists u,v\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=u\\land\\varphi_d(b)\\downarrow=v\\land u\\sim_\\tau v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HEO}_\\sigma&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\omega:e\\sim_\\sigma e\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\ne\\sim_{\\mathbf n}d&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow e=d,\\\\\ne\\sim_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}d&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow p_0(e)\\sim_\\sigma p_0(d)\\land p_1(e)\\sim_\\tau p_1(d),\\\\\ne\\sim_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}d&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl[a\\sim_\\sigma b\\Rightarrow\n\\exists u,v\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=u\\land\\varphi_d(b)\\downarrow=v\\land u\\sim_\\tau v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HEO}_\\sigma&amp;:=\\{e\\in\\omega:e\\sim_\\sigma e\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书箭头条款还显式列出两个函数各自对相等输入保持相等。对子类型的 PER 性归纳后，这与显示的交叉条款等价：由 a∼b 得 a∼a、b∼b，交叉条款的三次实例及输出 PER 的对称传递性给各自相容。反向取原书第一项即得本条款。不是只比较相同输入上两个任意程序的结果，也没有把 HEO 当作 HRO 的同一载体。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-realizer-finite-types","status":"resolved","id":"161f0473a5123eab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-realizer-finite-types","status":"resolved","id":"161f0473a5123eab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"类型与编号、配对取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]、[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]。$e,d,a,b,u,v\\in\\omega$，$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"类型与编号、配对取 [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]]、[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]。$e,d,a,b,u,v\\in\\omega$，$\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"e,d,a,b,u,v\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in\\mathcal{RT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sim_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HEO}_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\ne\\sim_{\\mathbf n}d&:\\Longleftrightarrow e=d,\\\\\ne\\sim_{\\sigma\\times_r\\tau}d&:\\Longleftrightarrow p_0(e)\\sim_\\sigma p_0(d)\\land p_1(e)\\sim_\\tau p_1(d),\\\\\ne\\sim_{\\sigma\\Rightarrow_r\\tau}d&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall a,b\\in\\omega\\ \\bigl[a\\sim_\\sigma b\\Rightarrow\n\\exists u,v\\in\\omega\\ (\\varphi_e(a)\\downarrow=u\\land\\varphi_d(b)\\downarrow=v\\land u\\sim_\\tau v)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{HEO}_\\sigma&:=\\{e\\in\\omega:e\\sim_\\sigma e\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2117,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-effective-operations]] · [[72-df-hereditarily-recursive-operations]] · [[72-df-modified-realizability-full-model]] · [[72-df-modified-realizer-type]] · [[72-df-partial-combinatory-algebra]] · [[72-df-realizer-finite-types]] · [[72-thm-combinatory-abstraction-beta]] · [[72-thm-heo-partial-equivalence]] · [[72-thm-kleene-first-pca]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-full-truth]] · [[72-thm-modified-realizability-witness]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-function-continuity]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-513","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增15项：[[72-df-applicative-term-evaluation]] · [[72-df-baire-neighborhood-function]] · [[72-df-combinatory-bracket-abstraction]] ·